            "Building HTTP service for {} v{} with {} tools",
            self.config.name,
            self.config.version,
            self.registry.tool_count()
        );
        StreamableHttpService::new(
            move || Ok(self.clone()),
            Arc::new(LocalSessionManager::default()),
            config,
        )
    }

    /// Convenience: serve HTTP on a given address with a minimal router.
    ///
